					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.163
				</span></i>
			; <i>cloudy,</i> of urine, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				79.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
